                                "sense_id": "9f424b63-16ab-31a5-a6d1-6dee4d4460e9",
                                "text": "In their eyes the past was good or bad for itself, and the present good or bad for itself, and an evil past could no more shadow a virtuous present than a virtuous present could retroact to brighten or redeem an ugly past."
                            }
